    "title": "Yakopro-Call.Video.Chat",
    "description": "Are you feeling bored with life?\u00a0 Want to make friends worldwide? Need something funny and meaningful?\u00a0Welcome to Yakopro! \ud83d\udc4d\r\n\r\nYakopro is a video call app that lets you make friends with strangers worldwide. With live video calling, you can communicate with strangers like face to face anytime and anywhere. Start finding new friends with Yakopro today. Click to open the world for you!\r\nYakopro has the following functions:\r\n\ud83e\udd1e1-on-1 Video Chat with Strangers\r\n- Make one-on-one video calls with people anywhere in the world.\r\n- You can choose to meet users from the country you want!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc6bReal-Time Video Call Chat\r\n-You can video chat with people from all over the world by random matching.\r\n-Discover new friends you are interested in and enjoy an interesting video chat experience!\r\n\r\nWhat are you waiting for? Come and join Yakopro! You can start live chat and live video calling anywhere, anytime! Live video calls with pretty girls or handsome boys from all over the world.\u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\udc4d",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you feeling bored with life?\u00a0 Want to make friends worldwide? Need something funny and meaningful?\u00a0Welcome to Yakopro! \ud83d\udc4d<br><br>Yakopro is a video call app that lets you make friends with strangers worldwide. With live video calling, you can communicate with strangers like face to face anytime and anywhere. Start finding new friends with Yakopro today. Click to open the world for you!<br>Yakopro has the following functions:<br>\ud83e\udd1e1-on-1 Video Chat with Strangers<br>- Make one-on-one video calls with people anywhere in the world.<br>- You can choose to meet users from the country you want!<br><br>\ud83d\udc6bReal-Time Video Call Chat<br>-You can video chat with people from all over the world by random matching.<br>-Discover new friends you are interested in and enjoy an interesting video chat experience!<br><br>What are you waiting for? Come and join Yakopro! You can start live chat and live video calling anywhere, anytime! Live video calls with pretty girls or handsome boys from all over the world.\u00a0\u00a0\ud83d\udc4d",
